Scope of this license (scope note):

This MIT license applies ONLY to the original additions created for the
MECoFlow research archive, including the files under `research/`,
`research_archive_extras/` (where not derived from upstream), the top-level
archive documents (README.md, README_ARCHIVE.md, ARCHIVE_MANIFEST.txt,
ARCHIVE_SHA256SUMS.txt), and any newly written modules inside
`code_snapshot/`.

`code_snapshot/` is a snapshot of the CAMS codebase
(https://github.com/ybyangjing/CAMS, arXiv:2511.16378) and of bundled
third-party code (e.g. FlowComposer). All rights in those files remain with
their original authors. This archive is published for the sole purpose of
documenting the author's personal research process.
